{"seq":2,"slug":"pharmacy","title":"药学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy","introMarkdown":"# 药学 简介\n\n药学是研究药物的发现、设计、制备、质量控制和合理使用的综合性学科，横跨化学、生物学和医学的交叉地带。从一个分子在实验室中被合成，到它作为一种安全有效的药物进入患者体内发挥治疗作用，整个过程涉及药物化学的分子设计、药理学的效应评价、药剂学的剂型开发和临床药学的合理用药指导。这条从分子到患者的完整链条，构成了药学学科的知识骨架。\n\n自学者进入药学领域时会发现，它要求一种独特的\"分子思维\"——始终关注药物分子的化学结构如何决定其生物活性、体内代谢方式和毒副作用。为什么阿司匹林能抑制前列腺素的合成？因为它的乙酰基能不可逆地修饰环氧化酶的活性位点。这种从分子结构到生物效应的因果链推理，是药学各分支共有的核心思维方式。\n\n第一章**药物化学**从药物分子的设计原理出发，探讨化学结构与生物活性之间的关系，帮助理解新药从何而来。第二章**药理学**分析药物在体内的动力学和效应学规律，是理解\"药物如何起效\"和\"为何会有副作用\"的理论基础。第三章**药剂学**关注药物的剂型设计和制备技术，从传统的片剂胶囊到现代的靶向给药系统。第四章**药学实践**涵盖临床药学服务、药品监管和中药学等应用方向。\n\n建议以一种你熟悉的药物为切入点——比如阿司匹林或青霉素——追踪它从分子发现到临床应用的完整故事，在具体案例中串联药学各分支的知识。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pharmaceutical-chemistry","title":"药物化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"drug-structure","title":"大学药学 — 药物的化学结构与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry/drug-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"synthetic-methods","title":"大学药学 — 药物合成方法与策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry/synthetic-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structure-activity","title":"大学药学 — 构效关系与药物设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-chemistry/structure-activity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pharmacology","title":"药理学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pharmacokinetics","title":"大学药学 — 药物代谢动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacology/pharmacokinetics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pharmacodynamics","title":"大学药学 — 药效动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacology/pharmacodynamics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"drug-interactions","title":"大学药学 — 药物相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacology/drug-interactions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"pharmaceutical-preparation","title":"药剂学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-preparation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dosage-forms","title":"大学药学 — 药物剂型与制剂设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-preparation/dosage-forms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"drug-delivery","title":"大学药学 — 药物递送系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-preparation/drug-delivery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pharmaceutical-quality","title":"大学药学 — 药品质量控制与分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmaceutical-preparation/pharmaceutical-quality"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"pharmacy-practice","title":"药学实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacy-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clinical-pharmacy","title":"大学药学 — 临床药学实践","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacy-practice/clinical-pharmacy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"drug-regulation","title":"大学药学 — 药品监管与法规","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacy-practice/drug-regulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pharmacoeconomics","title":"大学药学 — 药物经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacy-practice/pharmacoeconomics"}]}]}